  "description": "After Wash eliminates the need for tedious drying and the micro-scratches that occur during drying. Its formula breaks down the surface tension of the water, allowing it to run off easily. Simultaneously, After Wash creates a lubricating film that prevents micro-scratches from forming when drying with a towel. After Wash is sprayed onto the still-wet surface of the car after rinsing. It displaces the standing water, significantly facilitating the drying process. Less water remains, which can then be removed with a good drying towel without the risk of micro-scratches, thanks to the lubricants that form this lubricating film. With After Wash, detailing becomes optional after drying, as it already creates a beautiful, deep shine during the drying process. Existing waxes are not affected; on the contrary, their lifespan is even extended because the lubricating film reduces the mechanical abrasion of waxes and other sealants. It works on glass, paint, and plastic, and significantly improves the absorbency of dry wipes due to its polymer technology.",
